  "prefLabel": "Arch 306.01 License",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Arch 306.01 License. An applicant for licensure as an architect, who has met all the requirements of RSA 310-A:28 - RSA 310-A:52 and this chapter, and who has paid all of the fees, shall be issued a license by the OPLC.\n\nSource. #7944, eff 8-27-03; ss by #9097, eff 2-29-08; ss by #10904, eff 8-5-15; ss by #14553, eff 6-2-26, EXPIRES: 6-2-36",
